e Worlds:</strong> Every environment is richly detailed and interactive, filled with clues and secrets essential to unravelling the story. The game’s vast environments reward exploration, with each chapter introducing new locations and deeper mysteries to uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics and Sound:</strong> Powered by Unreal Engine 5, <strong>Who is Abby</strong> delivers cutting-edge visuals and immersive soundscapes, bringing Tom’s world to life with unparalleled realism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Control Customization:</strong> Enjoy seamless support for both keyboard and controller. Customize your experience with remappable keys for keyboard and mouse, as well as an invertible Y-axis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Bonus Museum Chapter:</strong> Venture deeper into the world of <strong>Who is Abby</strong> with a special museum chapter, packed with additional lore and secrets as you progress through the game. This bonus chapter adds even more depth to an already rich narrative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles to Discover:</strong> Scattered throughout the world, collectibles await your discovery, each one adding another layer to the mystery. The extensive world is filled with secrets that encourage replayability, as you strive to uncover everything the game has to offer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to uncover the truth.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Search for your missing sister in this stunning first-person adventure. A thrilling story where you unravel a mystery through exploration and puzzle-solving.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614800/386d390ee8813542f7682a385debc8d707ceb4b4/header.jpg?t=1766404876", "capsul